ck.com", "is_crosspost": false, "preview": "https://media.scored.co/preview/1ATVjgRT5d.png", "removal_source": "", "link": "https://glennbeck.com/read/articles/16-promises-trump-kept-before-the-midterms-and-four-he-hasnt", "author_flair_class": "", "is_removed": false, "media": {"resized_resolutions": [], "blurhash": "", "full_resolution": []}, "title": "Out of 20 campaign promises, Trump has already kept 16. THAT is truly amazing in any historical context. Please share with any retards who listen to fake news. ", "last_comment_created": 1792556393788, "content": "", "score_down": 0, "author_flair_text": "", "pro_tier": 0, "is_stickied": false, "is_nsfw": false, "is_deleted": false, "is_image": false, "comments": 6, "score_up": 31, "is_edited": false, "is_moderator": false, "awards": 0, "vote_state": 2, "link_metadata": {"description": "I didn't believe Donald Trump in 2016. I didn't think he could deliver on half the things he was promising, and even heading into his second term, I had my doubts. But with the midterms just two weeks away, it's time to look at the record. An image made by Blake Neff, from TPUSA, of a scorecard of Trump's 20 core campaign promises is making the rounds on X. This scorecard puts 16 in the win column; you can debate some of those checkmarks, but there's no denying that this administration has made substantial changes in less than two years.Here are the accomplishments that stand out.1. He secured the borderRemember when we were told securing the border was impossible without Congress?In December 2023, there were nearly 371,000 encounters at the border. This March, southwest border apprehensions were approximately 8,300 for the entire month.2. He delivered on mass deportationsTrump promised the largest deportation operation in American history, and so far he is delivering. His administration has dramatically exp", "large_image": "945Sc2OS6iqqrJf6.png", "title": "16 promises Trump kept before the midterms \u2014 and four he hasn't"}, "pos